    <briefdescription>
<para>GPU profiling integration for NVIDIA Nsight and AMD ROCm Profiler. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides named range markers and point events that are natively visible in:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>NVIDIA Nsight Systems / Nsight Compute (via NVTX, when THEMIS_ENABLE_CUDA)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>AMD ROCm Profiler / rocprof (via rocTX, when THEMIS_ENABLE_HIP)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>CPU-only builds: events are stored internally and exportable as Chrome trace JSON compatible with ROCm profiler&apos;s <computeroutput>--sys-trace</computeroutput> output.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
